## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cffff8000Disaster|rZone 3D rooms
## Notes: The 3D room of DisasterZone's chess hall (Karazhan's Gamesman's Hall). Loads only when the chess hall opens.
## Author: Casual Disaster
## Version: 0.2.4
## Dependencies: DisasterZone
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\DisasterZone\Media\Launcher\seal
## Category: Raid

# Loaded by DisasterZone (Render3D\Rooms.lua R3.LoadData) the first time a 3D view needs a room.
# Load.lua must stay first: it hands every file below DisasterZone's own namespace.
Load.lua

# WoW Forever draws one room: the chess hall's (DisasterZone_Chess\Board3D.lua, room "Karazhan:Chess"). The TBC raid
# rooms, the Raid Trainer's floors and their stand-ins stay in this folder for the strategy board, which is hidden on
# Forever: they are neither loaded nor shipped (dev/tools/release.py ships the files listed here). Their full list is
# the TBC fixture dev/fixtures/tbc/DisasterZone_Rooms/DisasterZone_Rooms.toc, which the generators rewrite.
Rooms\Karazhan_Chess.lua

# The room's stand-ins, gaps and depth modes (Gaps.lua and Modes.lua cover every room, the chess hall's included)
Standins\Gaps.lua
Standins\Karazhan_Chess.lua
Standins\Modes.lua
